  {
   "slug": "gram:yatto",
   "variants": [],
   "steps_unavailable": "Free adverb standing BEFORE the predicate (やっと終わった, やっと間に合う): it applies no operation to its host and takes no host of its own. The closed op enum only transforms a base and suffixes tokens to it, so no ordered step list can place やっと in front. The record's formation field is also incomplete — it opens with 'Também acompanha o presente…' and never states the base rule it is adding to — so there is nothing further to derive from.",
   "nuance_tags": [
    "emphasis"
   ],
